<p style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:1;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:2pt;margin-top:1.5pt;"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:6pt;font-variant:normal;text-transform:uppercase;">_____________________________________</span></p>
